INSERT INTO tennis_rules (source_file, rule_id, content, metadata, embedding) VALUES ('2026-rules-of-tennis-english.pdf', '23. THE LET', '23. THE LET
In all cases when a let is called, except when a service let is called on a second service,
the whole point shall be replayed.
Case 1: When the ball is in play, another ball rolls onto court. A let is called. The
server had previously served a fault. Is the server now entitled to a first service or
second service?
Decision: First service. The whole point must be replayed.
